# The eight wanderer roles: one topic each, on top of their built verbs (their special, Share some
# food, Rob). They speak for themselves, in the first person. No pronouns for them in our lines.

conv wanderer.trader.prices
for wanderer:trader
topic "Ask what sells these days."
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say "Batteries, always. Salt, since the shop in {here} went. Boots in your size, never."
  say "Jewellery sells to the Red Hand. Don't ask me what they do with it. They weigh it."
  > @cheap "Anything cheap?" -> cheap
  > @other "Something else." -> hub

node cheap
  say "Advice. Here's some: never buy a tin that's been opened and closed again."
  > @back1 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.doctor.work
for wanderer:doctor
topic "Ask how the work's going."
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say "Same as the old job. People come in hurt, I fix what I can, and I write down what I can't."
  say "The difference is nobody pays the electricity bill. Including me."
  > @shop "Compare what you carry." -> shop   if bg:doctor,nurse
  > @worst "What's the worst of it?" -> worst
  > @other2 "Something else." -> hub

node shop
  say "Show me yours. Hm. Gauze, good. That antiseptic is half water, whoever sold it to you."
  say "Clean a bite first, then argue. The first minutes are the ones that count."
  do learn:doctor.golden_window
  > @back2 "Something else." -> hub

node worst
  say "The bites people don't mention until the fever's up. By then I'm a witness, not a doctor."
  say "Tell someone early. Anyone. It's the only advice that's ever worked."
  > @back3 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.scavenger.where
for wanderer:scavenger
topic "Ask where they've been."
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say "Everywhere twice and nowhere I'd go a third time. {here} has a chemist with the shutters down."
  say "Down isn't locked. Down is just down."
  > @true "Is that true?" -> honest | shrug   check persuade none 2 bg:police,elder
  > @other3 "Something else." -> hub

node honest
  say "Mostly. The shutters are down because something leans on them from inside. I didn't stop to ask what."
  do learn:scav.chemist
  > @back4 "Something else." -> hub

node shrug
  say "True enough to sell. That's the only kind of true I can afford."
  > @back5 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.deserter.why
for wanderer:deserter
topic "Ask why they left Bastion."
prio world
voice plain

node start
  say "I didn't leave. On paper I'm dead. KIA, body not recovered. My name's still on their board."
  say "They'll read it at the roll tonight and the whole post will answer for me. That's the worst part."
  > @why2 "Why did you go?" -> why | silent   check persuade none 2 bg:soldier,police
  > @back "Could you go back?" -> back
  > @other4 "Something else." -> hub

node why
  say "Orders came that nobody read out. Then they burnt them in the stove. I'd read them first."
  say "I won't say what they said. I left because I'd have done it."
  do learn:bastion.orders_rumour
  > @back6 "Something else." -> hub

node silent
  say "Because I wanted to live more than I wanted to be counted. Leave it there."
  > @back7 "Something else." -> hub

node back
  say "If I walked in, they'd rub out the KIA, not the man. Then they'd hang me for it, properly signed for."
  > @back8 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.preacher.bells
for wanderer:preacher
topic "Ask about the bells."
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say "I ring them so the living know someone's still keeping time. The dead hear them too. I'm sure of it."
  say "I've asked the Lord which matters more. He's been quiet on it."
  > @danger "They draw the dead to town." -> danger
  > @other5 "Something else." -> hub

node danger
  say "They do. That's why I ring and walk on. You can ask me to stop for a while. I'll listen."
  > @back9 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.courier.post
for wanderer:courier
topic "Ask what's in the bag."
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say "Letters. People still write them. Half the addresses are houses that aren't there any more."
  say "I deliver those to the nearest house that is. Somebody reads them out. It helps, somehow."
  > @read "Do you ever read them?" -> read
  > @other6 "Something else." -> hub

node read
  say "Never. The day I start reading them is the day I start choosing which ones to lose."
  > @back10 "Something else." -> hub

conv wanderer.mechanic.cars
for wanderer:mechanic
topic "Ask what still runs."
prio flavour
voice plain

node start
  say "Anything with a carburettor and an owner who's dead. Fuel's the problem, not the cars."
  say "The Red Hand has most of the diesel. Ask them nicely and then check your pockets."
  > @fix "Can you teach me a trick?" -> fix   if bg:mechanic
  > @other7 "Something else." -> hub

node fix
  say "You know the tricks. Here's one you don't: the Bastion trucks use a different fuel cap. Take a spare."
  do learn:mechanic.bastion_caps
  > @back11 "Something else." -> hub
